  "title": "· New Bags · Dior Unveils New Book Tote Collection: A Tribute to Classic Literature",
  "original_title": "新包 | Dior 上架新一季 Book Tote 书封系列手袋：致敬经典文学作品",
  "excerpt": "Dior's new Book Tote collection features embroidered covers of four classic novels, blending literary tribute with playful elegance.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-06-29",
  "date_label": "June 29, 2026",
